Value Required MAC_ADDRESS ([0-9A-Fa-f]{4}(?:-[0-9A-Fa-f]{4}){2})
Value Required VLAN_ID (\d+)
Value Required STATE (\S+)
Value Required INTERFACE (\S+)
Value AGING (\S+)

Start
  ^MAC\s+Address\s+VLAN\s+ID\s+State\s+Port/Nickname\s+Aging\s*$$
  ^${MAC_ADDRESS}\s+${VLAN_ID}\s+${STATE}\s+${INTERFACE}\s+${AGING}\s*$$ -> Record
  ^\s*$$
  ^. -> Error
